+# BPEByte br_bt @ 1.3B — param/FLOP-matched to AU-Net 2 1.3B.
+# Identical hierarchical architecture to aunet2_1.3B_b200.yaml (dims [512,2048], layers [3,25],
+# ~1.305B non-embed params); the ONLY change is the patch-boundary strategy:
+#   regex.strategy word1 (word boundaries)  ->  bpe_br (llama3 BPE token boundaries).
+# "br" = before_root placement (boundary on the last byte of each BPE token, like AU-Net's
+# match.end()-1). Trained on the same DCLM corpus with the same recipe.
+# Mid-training HellaSwag/ARC-E (acc_norm) eval runs at 30/60/90/100% (eval_milestones below).
+# Launch: bash train_bpebyte.sh   (exports TMPDIR=/var/tmp; auto-resumes)
+#   or:    TMPDIR=/var/tmp torchrun --nproc-per-node 4 -m apps.aunet.train config=apps/aunet/configs/bpebyte_br_bt_1.3B.yaml
